---
interface Props { data:any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="salary-experience">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap crumb"><b>Trabajo</b> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Sueldo bruto y neto</div><div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Calculadora de sueldo 2026</span><h1>Del sueldo bruto<br>al dinero que<br>te queda en mano.</h1><p>Calculá tu neto, entendé cada descuento del recibo y compará cuánto cambia según tu situación.</p><div class="chips"><span>✓ Aportes con tope SIPA</span><span>🏛️ Ganancias 2026</span><span>🔒 Sin guardar datos</span></div>
        <div class="salary-art"><div class="payslip"><div class="slip-top"><b>Recibo de sueldo</b><span>julio 2026</span></div><div class="slip-gross">De un bruto de $1.500.000 te quedan</div><div class="slip-net">$1.245.000 <small>en mano</small></div><div class="slip-line"><span>Descuentos estimados</span><strong>−$255.000</strong></div></div><span class="discount-tag">17% de aportes</span><div class="stamp">NETO<br>ESTIMADO</div></div>
      </div>
      <form class="calc"><div class="calc-title"><div><h2>Calculá tu sueldo</h2><p>Empezamos del bruto al neto.</p></div><span class="tag">Valores vigentes</span></div>
        <div class="section-label">¿Qué necesitás calcular?</div><div class="cases"><button type="button" class="case active" data-case="bruto"><i>💼</i>Bruto a neto</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="neto"><i>🎯</i>Neto a bruto</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="recibo"><i>🧾</i>Recibo completo</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="mono"><i>🚀</i>Monotributista</button></div>
        <div class="section-label">Tus datos</div><div class="fields"><div class="field wide"><label id="amount-label">Sueldo bruto mensual</label><div class="inline"><b>$</b><input id="amount" value="1.500.000" inputmode="numeric"></div></div><div class="field"><label>Cónyuge a cargo</label><select id="salary-spouse"><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Sí</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Hijos a cargo</label><div class="inline"><input id="salary-children" type="number" min="0" value="0"><b>hijos</b></div></div><div class="field"><label>Cuota sindical</label><div class="inline"><input id="salary-union" type="number" min="0" max="20" value="0"><b>%</b></div></div><div class="field"><label>Otros descuentos</label><div class="inline"><b>$</b><input id="salary-other" value="0"></div></div></div>
        <div class="advanced"><span>✓ Tope previsional aplicado</span><b>+ Afinar cálculo</b></div><section class="result"><div class="result-top"><div><small id="result-label">Sueldo neto estimado</small><div class="price" id="result-price">$1.245.000</div></div><div class="percent"><small>Te queda</small><strong id="result-percent">83%</strong></div></div><div class="stats"><span>Aportes obligatorios<b id="salary-contrib">−$255.000</b></span><span>Otros descuentos<b id="salary-discounts">$0</b></span><span>Costo empleador<b id="salary-employer">$1.875.000</b></span></div><button class="go" type="button">Actualizar sueldo</button></section>
      </form>
    </div></section>
    <section class="detail wrap"><header class="center"><span>Tu recibo, sin letra chica</span><h2>Entendé adónde va cada peso</h2><p>El neto no es un porcentaje fijo: depende de aportes, topes, Ganancias y descuentos de convenio.</p></header><div class="detail-grid">
      <article class="card"><h3>De $1.500.000 bruto a tu bolsillo</h3><div class="row"><span>💼 Sueldo bruto</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:100%"></i></div><b>$1.500.000</b></div><div class="row"><span>− Jubilación 11%</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:11%"></i></div><b>−$165.000</b></div><div class="row"><span>− Obra social 3%</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:3%"></i></div><b>−$45.000</b></div><div class="row"><span>− PAMI 3%</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:3%"></i></div><b>−$45.000</b></div><div class="row"><span>− Ganancias</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:0%"></i></div><b>$0</b></div><div class="total"><strong>Neto en mano</strong><strong>$1.245.000</strong></div></article>
      <article class="card wallet"><h3>La foto rápida de tu sueldo</h3><div class="wallet-visual"><div class="coin big">83%</div><div class="coin small">−17%</div></div><div class="wallet-note"><i>💡</i><span>Hasta este nivel salarial, el descuento principal son los aportes personales. Si el bruto sube, puede aparecer Ganancias y también actuar el tope SIPA.</span></div><div class="ratio"><div><small>Por cada $100 brutos</small><b>$83 en mano</b></div><div><small>Descuentos</small><b>$17</b></div></div></article>
    </div></section>
    <section class="cases-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="cases-head"><div><span>Todos los casos</span><h2>Cuatro respuestas, según lo que necesitás</h2></div><div class="legend">Podés cambiar de caso sin perder tus datos</div></div><div class="case-grid">
      <article class="answer active"><i>💼</i><h3>Tengo el bruto</h3><p>Ingresá lo que figura arriba de tu recibo y calculá cuánto vas a cobrar.</p><b>$1.245.000</b><span>Neto estimado</span></article>
      <article class="answer"><i>🎯</i><h3>Quiero cobrar un neto</h3><p>Partí del monto que querés recibir y descubrí qué bruto deberían ofrecerte.</p><b>$1.445.783</b><span>Bruto necesario para $1.200.000</span></article>
      <article class="answer"><i>🧾</i><h3>Quiero el recibo completo</h3><p>Sumá antigüedad, vacaciones, aguinaldo y descuentos de convenio.</p><b>Concepto por concepto</b><span>Liquidación mensual detallada</span></article>
      <article class="answer"><i>🚀</i><h3>Soy monotributista</h3><p>Restá cuota, Ingresos Brutos y gastos para estimar tu ingreso disponible.</p><b>$1.380.610</b><span>Disponible sobre $1.500.000 facturados</span></article>
    </div></div></section>
    <section class="employer"><div class="wrap employer-grid"><div class="employer-copy"><span>La otra mitad del recibo</span><h2>Tu sueldo cuesta más que el bruto</h2><p>Además de tu remuneración, el empleador paga contribuciones patronales. Ver las tres cifras juntas ayuda a negociar mejor una oferta.</p></div><div class="cost-stack"><div class="cost-row"><label>Costo total</label><div class="track"><i></i></div><b>$1.875.000</b></div><div class="cost-row"><label>Sueldo bruto</label><div class="track"><i></i></div><b>$1.500.000</b></div><div class="cost-row"><label>Contribuciones</label><div class="track"><i></i></div><b>$375.000</b></div></div></div></section><div class="foot"></div>
  <section class="support wrap"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><aside><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}<small>{s.publisher}</small></a>)}</aside></section>
</div>
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.querySelector(".salary-experience"),q=s=>root.querySelector(s),all=s=>root.querySelectorAll(s),money=n=>"$"+Math.round(Math.max(0,n)||0).toLocaleString("es-AR"),num=el=>Number(String(el.value).replace(/\./g,"").replace(",","."))||0;let mode="bruto";
const netFromGross=g=>{const union=Math.max(0,num(q("#salary-union")))/100*g,other=Math.max(0,num(q("#salary-other"))),contrib=Math.min(g,3500000)*.17,net=Math.max(0,g-contrib-union-other);return{net,contrib,other:union+other}};
const calc=()=>{const entered=Math.max(0,num(q("#amount")));let gross=entered,net=0,contrib=0,other=0;if(mode==="neto"){let lo=entered,hi=Math.max(entered*2,1);for(let i=0;i<45;i++){const mid=(lo+hi)/2;if(netFromGross(mid).net<entered)lo=mid;else hi=mid}gross=hi;({net,contrib,other}=netFromGross(gross))}else if(mode==="mono"){gross=entered;contrib=75000;other=gross*.035;net=Math.max(0,gross-contrib-other)}else({net,contrib,other}=netFromGross(gross));q("#result-label").textContent=mode==="neto"?"Bruto necesario estimado":mode==="mono"?"Ingreso disponible estimado":mode==="recibo"?"Total neto del recibo":"Sueldo neto estimado";q("#result-price").textContent=money(mode==="neto"?gross:net);q("#result-percent").textContent=mode==="neto"?"Objetivo":gross?Math.round(net/gross*100)+"%":"0%";q("#salary-contrib").textContent="−"+money(contrib);q("#salary-discounts").textContent="−"+money(other);q("#salary-employer").textContent=money(gross*1.25)};
all(".case").forEach(btn=>btn.addEventListener("click",()=>{all(".case").forEach(x=>x.classList.remove("active"));btn.classList.add("active");mode=btn.dataset.case;q("#amount-label").textContent=mode==="neto"?"Neto que querés cobrar":mode==="mono"?"Facturación mensual":"Sueldo bruto mensual";calc()}));all(".calc input,.calc select").forEach(el=>el.addEventListener("input",calc));q(".go").addEventListener("click",e=>{calc();e.currentTarget.textContent="✓ Cálculo actualizado";setTimeout(()=>e.currentTarget.textContent="Actualizar sueldo",1200)});calc()})();
</script>
<style>
.salary-experience{width:100%;overflow:hidden;color:#111f39;background:#fff;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#10223c;background:#fff}button,input,select{font:inherit}button:focus{outline:none}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
    .top{height:88px;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe8ee;display:flex;align-items:center;background:#fff}.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:18px;font-weight:850}.logo{width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:7px;background:#173452;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:14px}.links,.tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px}.links a{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#43526a;text-decoration:none}.tools span{border:1px solid #d9e2eb;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.tools .profile{background:#132844;color:#fff;border-color:#132844}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(128deg,#f7fbfd 0%,#f7fbfd 60%,#edf9f7 100%);padding:25px 0 62px;overflow:hidden}.crumb{font-size:12px;color:#718299;margin-bottom:33px}.crumb b{color:#087e72}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:52px;align-items:start}.hero-grid>*{min-width:0}.copy{padding-top:6px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#07877a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:#08a292}.copy h1{font-size:51px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.052em;margin:18px 0;color:#0e1d36}.copy>p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#5f7187;max-width:500px}.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:23px}.chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe5e9;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;color:#53677e;font-size:10px}
    .salary-art{height:240px;margin-top:16px;position:relative}.payslip{position:absolute;left:57px;top:18px;width:260px;height:188px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e5e7;border-radius:17px;box-shadow:0 24px 48px #17385816;padding:21px 23px;transform:rotate(-2deg)}.slip-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.slip-top b{font-size:11px}.slip-top span{font-size:8px;color:#087e72;background:#e8f7f4;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:99px}.slip-gross{font-size:9px;color:#73869a;margin-top:18px}.slip-net{font-size:28px;font-weight:900;color:#173858;margin-top:3px}.slip-net small{font-size:9px;color:#6f8295;font-weight:500}.slip-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #e1eaed;margin-top:13px;padding-top:10px;font-size:9px}.slip-line strong{color:#087e72}.stamp{position:absolute;right:40px;bottom:9px;width:84px;height:84px;border-radius:50%;background:#0b9486;color:#fff;border:8px solid #e3f5f1;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;font-size:9px;font-weight:850;transform:rotate(8deg)}.discount-tag{position:absolute;left:4px;bottom:17px;background:#fff4de;color:#81591b;border:1px solid #efd9ad;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}
    .calc{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8e5e8;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 29px;box-shadow:0 25px 60px #173b6418;position:relative;z-index:2}.calc-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.calc h2{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 4px}.calc-title p{font-size:10px;color:#6b7d91;margin:0}.tag{font-size:9px;color:#087e72;background:#e8f7f4;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 10px;font-weight:800;height:max-content;white-space:nowrap}.section-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:850;color:#293b53;margin:17px 0 8px}.cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px}.case{border:1px solid #dce5e8;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 5px;color:#5d7188;font-size:8px;font-weight:750;min-height:65px;cursor:pointer}.case i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:3px}.case.active{border:2px solid #079587;background:#effaf8;color:#087b70}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.field{border:1px solid #dbe4e8;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;min-height:57px}.field.wide{grid-column:span 2}.field label{display:block;color:#77879a;font-size:8px;margin-bottom:5px}.field input,.field select{border:0;outline:0;background:none;width:100%;color:#142641;font-weight:750;font-size:13px}.inline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}.inline b{font-size:12px}.advanced{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:11px 0;color:#65788d;font-size:9px}.advanced b{color:#087e72}.result{background:#17324f;color:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:18px 20px}.result-top{display:flex;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between}.result small{font-size:9px;color:#b9cbdd}.price{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:850;margin-top:4px}.percent{background:#dff5f1;color:#08776d;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 11px;text-align:right}.percent strong{display:block;font-size:15px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;border-top:1px solid #375675;padding-top:12px;margin-top:13px}.stats span{font-size:8px;color:#afc0d1}.stats b{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}.go{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:#0a9587;color:#fff;font-weight:800;padding:12px;margin-top:14px;cursor:pointer}
    .detail{padding:74px 0 67px}.center{text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 36px}.center span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#07877a;font-weight:850}.center h2{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0}.center p{color:#687a8f;line-height:1.6}.detail-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:20px}.card{border:1px solid #dce5e8;border-radius:16px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 10px 27px #1738580b}.card h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 19px}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:165px 1fr 105px;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:15px 0}.row span{font-size:10px;font-weight:750}.bar{height:8px;background:#edf2f4;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}.bar i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:#0b9587}.row:nth-child(3) .bar i{background:#3f83d1}.row:nth-child(4) .bar i{background:#8065c8}.row:nth-child(5) .bar i{background:#e0a642}.row b{text-align:right;font-size:12px}.total{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #e1e7e9;margin-top:20px;padding-top:17px}.total strong:last-child{color:#087e72;font-size:19px}
    .wallet{background:#f8fbfc;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.wallet-visual{height:138px;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center}.coin{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900}.coin.big{width:94px;height:94px;background:#dff5f1;color:#08796f;font-size:21px;border:7px solid #effaf8}.coin.small{width:54px;height:54px;background:#fff0ce;color:#8a6019;font-size:12px;right:58px;bottom:4px;border:5px solid #fff8e9}.wallet-note{background:#eaf7f5;border:1px solid #cce8e3;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;display:flex;gap:10px;color:#38665f;font-size:10px;line-height:1.55}.wallet-note i{font-style:normal;font-size:18px}.ratio{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px;margin-top:14px}.ratio div{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce6e8;border-radius:10px;padding:12px}.ratio small{display:block;color:#74869a;font-size:8px}.ratio b{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:14px}
    .cases-section{background:#f3f8f8;padding:69px 0}.cases-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:27px}.cases-head h2{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0 0}.cases-head>div>span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#07877a;font-weight:850}.legend{font-size:9px;color:#64778d}.case-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}.answer{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5e8;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;min-height:190px;transition:.2s}.answer:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 13px 30px #17385810}.answer i{font-style:normal;font-size:23px}.answer h3{font-size:13px;margin:11px 0 6px}.answer p{font-size:9px;color:#77899c;line-height:1.55;margin:0}.answer b{display:block;color:#087e72;font-size:16px;margin-top:18px}.answer span{display:block;color:#75889b;font-size:8px;margin-top:3px}.answer.active{border:2px solid #0a9587;background:#f5fcfa}.answer.active:after{content:"Caso seleccionado";display:inline-block;background:#dff5f1;color:#08786e;font-size:8px;font-weight:800;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:99px;margin-top:12px}
